      "message": "Adding Keith, expert at all things Kconfig.\n\nIn most situations like this where we\u0027re trying to point to a specific sensor, we use some kind of devicetree phandle. But I\u0027m uncertain how that would work together with this (perhaps more of these Kconfig items would instead be in a devicetree node?)",
